00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
A contingency is a reasoned allowance for identified uncertainty, not a guaranteed amount or permission to ignore missing quotes.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
If a scoped estimate is $1,000 and a 10% illustrative reserve is used, show $100 separately and explain the risk basis.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Estimate revision

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
These are teaching relationships, not live prices, quotes, tax advice or a forecast. State every assumption.

